me": "Bow-Bots", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Early Access Notice: Bow-Bots is still in development, so you may encounter unfinished features and areas that need polishing. And by that, I mean a lot of polish! :)\n\nOur player base is currently small, so we recommend inviting a friend to join you for the best experience! \n\nBow-Bots is a passion project crafted by a very small team, and we\u2019d love your feedback to help improve it. Join our Discord community and be part of the journey!\n\n\ud83c\udfaf Join the Official Discord\ud83c\udfaf https://discord.gg/6QFVexRkYn\n\n\ud83c\udff9 About Bow-Bots \ud83c\udff9\n\nBow-Bots pits you against other players in a thrilling 6-player free-for-all, with an upcoming 3v3 mode. \n\nArmed only with a bow and arrow, you'll navigate a game within a game. Bow-Bots features a unique item system where hitting targets around the map grants you powerful arrows. Landing a shot on the golden bullseyes makes your arrows even more powerful. \n\nThe better your aim, the better your equipment. Experience the excitement and strategy of Bow-Bots!", "short_description": "\ud83c\udff9 About Bow-Bots \ud83c\udff9\n\nBow-Bots pits you against other players in a thrilling 6-player free-for-all, with an upcoming 3v3 mode. Armed only with a bow and arrow, you'll navigate a game within a game. Bow-Bots features a unique item system where hitting targets around the map grants you powerful arrows. Landing a shot on the golden bullseyes makes your arrows even more powerful. The better your aim, the better your equipment. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://info05427.wixsite.com/my-site/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Siege Industries", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://info05427.wixsite.com/my-site/privacypolicy", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "contex